From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 08:21:25 +0000
Subject: phy: cix: usb2: defer until the reset controller is ready

The PHYs can probe before the sky1 reset controller. The reset lookup
then returns -EPROBE_DEFER, but the probe returned 0, so the PHY reset
stayed asserted. Return the error, so the probe runs again later.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
Signed-off-by: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
---
 drivers/phy/cix/phy-cix-usb2.c | 11 ++++------
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/phy/cix/phy-cix-usb2.c b/drivers/phy/cix/phy-cix-usb2.c
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/drivers/phy/cix/phy-cix-usb2.c
+++ b/drivers/phy/cix/phy-cix-usb2.c
@@ -31,14 +31,11 @@ static int cix_usb2phy_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 	struct reset_control *preset;
 
 	preset = devm_reset_control_get(dev, "preset");
+	if (IS_ERR(preset))
+		return dev_err_probe(dev, PTR_ERR(preset),
+				     "failed to get preset\n");
 
-	if (IS_ERR(preset)) {
-		dev_err(dev, "%s: failed to get preset\n", __func__);
-	} else {
-		reset_control_deassert(preset);
-	}
-
-	return 0;
+	return reset_control_deassert(preset);
 }
 
 static struct platform_driver cix_usb2phy_driver = {
-- 
